WEBVTT

00:24:58.456 --> 00:25:01.106
you are lagging in language, 
are lagging in everything.

00:25:01.106 --> 00:25:04.766
So, what we are trying to do
is we're trying to really promote

00:25:04.766 --> 00:25:07.936
and get this language, 
again, back into the level

00:25:07.936 --> 00:25:11.766
where people start using it, 
it starts really being active,

00:25:11.766 --> 00:25:13.596
and this is, again, as I said,

00:25:13.596 --> 00:25:16.166
similar to what everything 
the Foundation does.

00:25:16.166 --> 00:25:18.504
It supports the language development,

00:25:18.504 --> 00:25:21.815
it supports the publication and writing,

00:25:21.815 --> 00:25:25.096
whether it's an academic 
or non-academic book

00:25:25.096 --> 00:25:27.246
in the language and promotes that,

00:25:27.246 --> 00:25:31.327
it's also providing 
the generation of entrepreneurs